{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-blog-post-js","path":"/git-config/","result":{"data":{"site":{"siteMetadata":{"title":"Overblog","author":"zitup"}},"markdownRemark":{"id":"6d19636d-28d2-5a37-a6cf-dc261f3f30cd","html":"<p>为了区分公司项目和个人项目，往往需要配置不同的用户名和邮箱。Git 支持全局配置和本地配置，但是本地配置只能修改一个项目，如果每个项目都需要配置，往往会遗忘，造成提交信息的错误。</p>\n<p>所幸 git 提供了针对文件夹级别的配置方式。</p>\n<ol>\n<li>首先新建两个配置文件，我们取名为 <code class=\"language-text\">~/.gitconfig-personal</code> 和 <code class=\"language-text\">~/.gitconfig-work</code>，内容为：</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"bash\"><pre class=\"language-bash\"><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>user<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n\n  name <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> xxx\n  email <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> xxx@xxx.com</code></pre></div>\n<p>名称和邮箱根据不同文件自己定义。</p>\n<ol start=\"2\">\n<li>然后再新建一个总的配置文件 <code class=\"language-text\">~/.gitconfig</code>，内容大致为：</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"bash\"><pre class=\"language-bash\"><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>includeIf <span class=\"token string\">\"gitdir:~/work/\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n  path <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> ~/.gitconfig-work\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>includeIf <span class=\"token string\">\"gitdir:~/project/\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n  path <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> ~/.gitconfig-personal</code></pre></div>\n<p>配置的意思就是根据不同的路径，选择不同的配置文件。</p>\n<p>以上两步就完成了，最后在不同的项目下使用以下命令，查看是否配置成功即可：</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"bash\"><pre class=\"language-bash\"><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"token function\">git</span> config --show-origin --get user.name\n<span class=\"token function\">git</span> config --show-origin --get user.email</code></pre></div>","timeToRead":1,"frontmatter":{"title":"Git 为不同文件夹配置不同的用户名和邮箱","date":"April 07, 2022","spoiler":"Git tip","cta":"tips"},"fields":{"slug":"/git-config/","langKey":"en"}}},"pageContext":{"slug":"/git-config/","previous":{"fields":{"slug":"/polkadot/","langKey":"en","directoryName":"polkadot"},"frontmatter":{"title":"Polkadot{.js} 学习"}},"next":null,"translations":[],"translatedLinks":[]}},"staticQueryHashes":["708209134"]}